        ("Start in Coach style (untick: Hints)", "以教练模式启动（取消勾选：提示）"),
        ("The AI coach has two styles. Hints shows its opinion while you decide: a score on\neach card, a ranked list of moves, a win-chance bar and the route it likes on the\nmap. Coach shows nothing before you act -- press F5 to peek at its next pick -- and\nafterwards a small note says where your turn or choice differed from its own.\nF8 turns it on / off; the Spire Mentor badge's Mode switch picks the style.\nIt switches on when the game starts (untick\nthat below if you would rather press F8), and it never plays for you unless you\nask it to (F7).", "AI 教练有两种模式。提示模式在你决策时显示它的看法：每张牌的评分、\n行动排名、胜率条，以及它在地图上推荐的路线。教练模式在你行动前\n不显示任何内容——按 F5 可偷看它的下一个选择——事后会有一条小提示，\n指出你的回合或选择与它的不同之处。\nF8 开 / 关 AI；Spire Mentor 徽章的模式开关用于选择模式。\n它会在游戏启动时开启（如果你更想手动按 F8，请取消下方勾选），\n除非你要求（F7），它绝不会替你游玩。"),
        ("Turn the coach on when the game starts", "游戏启动时开启教练"),
