        ("[b]Keys[/b]\n", "[b]按键[/b]\n"),
        ("\n[b]The Spire Mentor badge[/b]\n", "\n[b]Spire Mentor 徽章[/b]\n"),
        ("[color=#c8ccd4]The badge in the top right, under the game's map / deck / settings buttons, shows the mode by its colour and word — grey Off, cyan Coach, green Hints, amber while the AI plays — and what the advisor is doing (thinking, starting, offline, building the engine). Click it for everything the keys do, with the mouse; click it again, click anywhere else or press Esc to close it. Drag its [b]⠿[/b] grip to move it; double-click the grip to put it back.\n[b]Mode[/b]: Off · Coach · Hints · AI plays (the AI plays this run until you stop it, as F7 does). [b]This decision[/b]: Peek, Let AI pick. [b]Autoplay[/b]: Autobattle, AI plays until stopped. [b]Speed[/b]. [b]More[/b]: [b]Rewind ▾[/b] (turn / room / one room back), [b]Panels ▾[/b] (hide all, log, HUD, help, Settings — that one works mid-run — and Report a bug) and [b]Workbench ▾[/b], whose [b]Open workbench[/b] opens the browser view (logs, search tree, run tree) and [b]Copy state[/b] puts this exact position on the clipboard — paste it into the workbench's [b]Import state[/b] to replay it, try other lines, or sweep it in SimLab.\nWhile the AI plays, an amber frame runs round the screen and a [b]Stop[/b] button sits next to the badge; in a co-op fight with AI partners, so does [b]Partner go[/b].[/color]\n", "[color=#c8ccd4]徽章位于右上角、游戏的地图 / 牌组 / 设置按钮下方，用颜色和文字显示当前模式——灰色为关闭、青色为教练、绿色为提示、AI 游玩时为琥珀色——以及顾问正在做什么（思考中、启动中、离线、正在构建引擎）。点击它即可用鼠标完成所有按键能做的事；再次点击、点击其他任意位置或按 Esc 关闭。拖动其 [b]⠿[/b] 手柄可移动它；双击手柄复位。\n[b]模式[/b]：关闭 · 教练 · 提示 · AI 游玩（AI 游玩本局直到你停止它，同 F7）。[b]本次决策[/b]：偷看、让 AI 选择。[b]自动游玩[/b]：自动战斗、AI 持续游玩直到停止。[b]速度[/b]。[b]更多[/b]：[b]回退 ▾[/b]（回合 / 房间 / 后退一个房间）、[b]面板 ▾[/b]（全部隐藏、日志、HUD、帮助、设置——对局中也可用——以及报告问题）和 [b]工作台 ▾[/b]，其中 [b]打开工作台[/b] 会打开浏览器视图（日志、搜索树、对局树），[b]复制状态[/b] 会将当前局面复制到剪贴板——粘贴到工作台的 [b]导入状态[/b] 中即可回放、尝试其他打法，或在 SimLab 中扫描。\nAI 游玩时，屏幕四周会出现琥珀色边框，徽章旁会出现 [b]停止[/b] 按钮；在有 AI 队友的合作战斗中，还会出现 [b]队友行动[/b] 按钮。[/color]\n"),
        ("\n[b]Rewind[/b]\n", "\n[b]回退[/b]\n"),
        ("[color=#c8ccd4][b]⟲ Turn[/b] (More › Rewind ▾) replays this combat to the start of the turn; [b]⟲ Room[/b] / [b]⟲⟲ Back[/b] jump to room-entry saves (same seed, exact state — a different line afterwards diverges legitimately). The workbench's game tree can rewind to any earlier room — or any recorded combat turn, replaying that fight's tape — and shows where lines forked.[/color]\n", "[color=#c8ccd4][b]⟲ 回合[/b]（更多 › 回退 ▾）将本场战斗重放到本回合开始；[b]⟲ 房间[/b] / [b]⟲⟲ 后退[/b] 跳转到进入房间时的存档（相同种子，完全相同的状态——之后打法不同，结果自然会不同）。工作台的游戏树可以回退到任意更早的房间——或任意已记录的战斗回合，通过重放该场战斗的记录——并显示各条打法的分岔点。[/color]\n"),
        ("\n[b]Who answers[/b]\n", "\n[b]由谁作答[/b]\n"),
        ("[color=#c8ccd4][b]Instinct[/b], the end-to-end net, plays every decision on gut feel, no search. Where it cannot play the run or a position yet, the search answers instead (it looks ahead through the fight, and a run net picks on the screens), and the advice says so.[/color]\n", "[color=#c8ccd4][b]直觉[/b]是端到端网络，凭直觉做出每个决策，不做搜索。当它还无法处理本局或某个局面时，改由搜索作答（在战斗中向前推演，并由一个对局网络在各界面上做选择），建议中会注明这一点。[/color]\n"),
        ("\n[b]What the coach draws[/b]\n", "\n[b]教练会显示什么[/b]\n"),
        ("[color=#c8ccd4][b]Hints[/b]: a score on each card in hand, a ranked list of the moves it considered, a win-chance bar, and markers on the map for the route it likes. Each of those can be switched off on the settings page.\n[b]Coach[/b]: none of that before you act. [b]F5[/b] shows its pick for the next decision only. After a turn that cost HP or win chance — or a choice it clearly disagrees with — a small note shows what it would have done and why (click it to keep it; good turns stay quiet unless you ask for a ✓ in the settings). Both styles get those notes.[/color]\n", "[color=#c8ccd4][b]提示[/b]：手牌中每张牌的评分、它考虑过的行动排名、胜率条，以及地图上它推荐路线的标记。这些都可以在设置页中分别关闭。\n[b]教练[/b]：你行动前不显示以上任何内容。[b]F5[/b] 仅显示它对下一个决策的选择。当某个回合损失了生命或胜率——或某个选择它明显不认同——会出现一条小提示，说明它会怎么做以及原因（点击可保留；表现好的回合不会提示，除非你在设置中开启 ✓）。两种模式都会显示这些提示。[/color]\n"),
        ("\n[b]Settings[/b]\n", "\n[b]设置[/b]\n"),
        ("[color=#c8ccd4]Main menu → Options → Mod Configuration → SpireMentor, or the badge's [b]More › Panels ▾ › Settings[/b] — that one works mid-run too.[/color]\n", "[color=#c8ccd4]主菜单 → 选项 → 模组配置 → SpireMentor，或徽章的 [b]更多 › 面板 ▾ › 设置[/b]——后者在对局中也可用。[/color]\n"),
        ("\n[b]Files[/b]\n", "\n[b]文件[/b]\n"),
        ("[color=#c8ccd4]Config:  %LOCALAPPDATA%\\SpireMentor\\SpireMentor.conf\nLogs:    %LOCALAPPDATA%\\SpireMentor\\advisor_stdout.log[/color]\n", "[color=#c8ccd4]配置：  %LOCALAPPDATA%\\SpireMentor\\SpireMentor.conf\n日志：  %LOCALAPPDATA%\\SpireMentor\\advisor_stdout.log[/color]\n"),
        ("\n[color=#5b6070]F1 closes this.[/color]", "\n[color=#5b6070]按 F1 关闭此面板。[/color]"),
